				Hdt.
				9.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.1.37
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχέων θριγκοὺς ἀ.</span>
